[{"title":"五泄山三学院十题 其二 西源","author":"释咸润","text":"造化凿绅维，千岩斗空碧。\n有时云雨开，残阳落幽石。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16307,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"五泄山三学院十题 其十 摘星岩","author":"释咸润","text":"扪萝梯峭石，直上青云端。\n咫尺星斗光，冷射人心寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16308,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观音诗 其一","author":"释契适","text":"金沙池袅玉莲馨，殿阁阶墀尽水精。\n云化路歧通万国，风飘舟楫济群生。\n座妆圭璧霜犹暗，衣缀珠玑月不明。\n若向险途逢八难，只劳心念讽持名。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16309,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观音诗 其三","author":"释契适","text":"慧炬慈航在世间，除昏济险未尝闲。\n手擎一穗青丝柳，身倚千层碧玉山。\n声满诸天常讽诵，功圆十地绝跻攀。\n终求郢妙雕金相，时献香花礼粹颜。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16310,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观音诗 其八","author":"释契适","text":"寂照慈威化不同，闻声清净得殊功。\n指光远射神龙烛，眉彩修弯帝释弓。\n宝器晓凝兰穗露，珠衣秋响桂枝风。\n信知万里从人欲，何患周游鬼国中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16311,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观音诗 其十","author":"释契适","text":"觉源非有等差心，物性陶溶逐浅深。\n昏惑道中瞻月角，辨才门里听潮音。\n彩云轻罩山辉玉，花雨斜飞地涌金。\n终拟龙绡图画看，供承香火老东林。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16312,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观音诗 其二","author":"释契适","text":"渊智弘慈大辨才，端居波上绝纤埃。\n祥光射散千门病，甘露倾消万国灾。\n翠柳变成金世界，白莲涌出玉楼台。\n我今稽首焚香礼，愿向人间应念来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16313,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观音诗 其五","author":"释契适","text":"水面红鲜耻绛唇，寻常侍从有天神。\n整齐绀发云千缕，端丽慈容月一轮。\n素舸欲沉威济物，霜刀曾断福沾人。\n世间多少诚心者，智烛惟求照耀身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16314,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观音诗 其九","author":"释契适","text":"宴坐琼瑶曲密都，感通宁肯择贤愚。\n遍分智慧灯开暗，尽洒清凉雨发枯。\n荷拥夕池鲜五色，树凝春砌瑩三珠。\n波神天女相随从，虚白光中美丈夫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16315,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观音诗 其七","author":"释契适","text":"水精盘跃锦鳞鱼，閟宇渊沉海岸居。\n秀世竹鸣金鸑鷟，观空波涌玉蟾蜍。\n轻明缨络垂身后，重叠芙蓉衬足初。\n曾向梦中潜祐我，烁人仪表降蓬庐。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16316,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观音诗 其六","author":"释契适","text":"天花环绕瑞云随，整救湮沦万类时。\n贵贱若能勤行愿，死生常得睹容仪。\n狻猊番掷琼台角，鹦鹉回翔宝树枝。\n永劫只将权实化，有情皆使入无为。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16317,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观音诗 其四","author":"释契适","text":"方圭座压五云端，修竹丛边舞玉鸾。\n施果狖离苍岫晚，献珠龙透碧波寒。\n琉璃瓶对珊瑚印，翡翠环摇玳瑁冠。\n百宝阶前文石上，天人瞻礼爇旃檀。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16318,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释宣能","text":"石巩箭，秘魔叉。\n直下会得，眼里空华。\n堪悲堪笑少林客，暗携只履度流沙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16319,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"呈东林道颜禅师颂","author":"释彦充","text":"为人须为彻，杀人不见血。\n德山与岩头，万里一条铁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16320,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释彦充","text":"世尊不说说，迦叶不闻闻。\n水流黄叶来何处，牛带寒鸦过远村。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16321,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古五首 其五","author":"释彦岑","text":"没踪迹处莫藏身，看来端是眼中尘。\n全机打破系驴橛，棒头敲出玉麒麟。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16322,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古五首 其四","author":"释彦岑","text":"一桡打著这瞎汉，堪笑令犹行一半。\n竿头丝线钓鲸波，趯浪拿云犹是钝。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16323,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古五首 其三","author":"释彦岑","text":"岣嵝峰头神禹碑，字青石赤形模奇。\n无目仙人才一见，便应抚掌笑嘻嘻。\n云暗苍龙化葛陂。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16324,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古五首 其二","author":"释彦岑","text":"蛮奴赤脚上皇州，卖尽奇珍跨白牛。\n贪著市朝人作市，又随歌舞上官楼。\n多意气，好风流，月冷珠帘挂玉钩。\n分明忘却来时路，百尺竿头辊绣毬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16325,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古五首 其一","author":"释彦岑","text":"胡孙吃毛虫，乌狗上佛殿。\n大地雪漫漫，澄江净如练。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16326,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释彦岑","text":"今朝八月初五，好事分明为举。\n岭头漠漠秋云，树底鸣鸠唤雨。\n昨夜东海鲤鱼，吞却南山猛虎。\n虽然有照有用，毕竟无宾无主。\n唯有文殊普贤，住，住，我识得你。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16327,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"圆相观音菩萨瑞像颂","author":"释彦泯","text":"妙觉慈悲主，身云瑩碧霞。\n光轮停夜月，璎珞缀千花。\n无畏全心普，分形应类差。\n圆通斯第一，名号遍恒沙。\n处处得消息，头头感叹嗟。\n和风飞语燕，斜日噪寒鸦。\n昂首清尘眼，称名断苦芽。\n谛观圆满相，砧杵落谁家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16328,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"山居","author":"释彦强","text":"老矣毋能役，岩分草草缘。\n放渠藜六尺，销得屋三椽。\n雪尽收茶早，云晴拾菌鲜。\n有时临近涧，揎手弄潺湲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16329,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句","author":"释彦强","text":"一间茅屋元无主，付与山头野火烧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16330,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二首 其一","author":"释思业","text":"昨日夜叉心，今朝菩萨面。\n菩萨与夜叉，不隔一条绵。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16331,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂二首 其二","author":"释思业","text":"勘破婆子，面青眼黑。\n赵州老汉，瞒我不得。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16332,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释思彻","text":"羊头车子推明月，没底船儿载晓风。\n一句顿超情量外，道无南北与西东。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16333,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九首 其九","author":"释思岳","text":"问佛答云乾屎橛，明明此理难分雪。\n金刚宝剑倒杀人，钝钢止用新罗铁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16334,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九首 其七","author":"释思岳","text":"本是山中人，爱说山中话。\n五月卖松风，人间恐无价。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16335,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九首 其五","author":"释思岳","text":"明明搅动一缸屎，却把麝香烧旖旎。\n许多香气不曾闻，浑身坐在屎缸里。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16336,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九首 其四","author":"释思岳","text":"时清休唱太平歌，大冶红垆著一毛。\n试向其中撮灰烬，亘天红焰已周遭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16337,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂七首 其五","author":"释思岳","text":"谁道霜风只一般，今年寒胜去年寒。\n夜来得个真消息，无限鲇鱼上竹竿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16338,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九首 其六","author":"释思岳","text":"一句举扬宗旨事，法堂上草亦须荒。\n回头却说人间话，大地山河常放光。\n光未明，无有佛，三条椽下好商量。\n岑大虫，岑大虫，澧州水，朗州峰。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16339,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈二首 其二","author":"释思岳","text":"二祖偿宿债，万法绝对待。\n一心无挂碍，浮山有九带。\n十方虚空圆陀陀，无量法门百杂碎。\n若言其有，非内非外。\n若言其无，无在不在。\n知与理冥，境与神会。\n如牛拽磨，似水打碓。\n三千里外逢人东倒西■，十字街头遇贱则贵。","collection":"宋","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16340,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈二首 其一","author":"释思岳","text":"腊月初，岁云徂。\n黄河冻已合，深处有嘉鱼。\n活鱍鱍，跳不脱，又不能相煦以湿相濡以沫。\n惭愧菩萨摩诃萨，春风几时来。\n解此黄河冻，令鱼化作龙，直透桃花浪。\n会即便会，痴人面前且莫说梦。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16341,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂七首 其七","author":"释思岳","text":"世尊不说一个字，大藏小藏从此出。\n达磨九年面壁来，得皮得髓分优劣。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16342,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂七首 其六","author":"释思岳","text":"炉已开，炭未有，衲僧暖地且相守。\n忽然乞得火种来，切忌烧脚又烧手。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16343,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂七首 其四","author":"释思岳","text":"今年是闰年，剩著三十日。\n返究所剩底，添些浮逼逼。\n世间没量人，一切但省力。\n净众此密语，说了却不密。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16344,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂七首 其三","author":"释思岳","text":"一叶飘丹，乾坤独露。\n万缘泯迹，法界全彰。\n沩山水牯牛，大雄白额虎。\n河阳新妇子，临际小厮儿。\n虽然借路经过，拶著扶篱摸壁。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16345,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂七首 其二","author":"释思岳","text":"芭蕉闻雷开，耳在什么处。\n葵花随日转，眼在什么处。\n若还眼耳分明，透出千门万户。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16346,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈颂七首 其一","author":"释思岳","text":"鼓山不跨石门句，嚼碎令人牙齿寒。\n亲扣国师问端的，石门无锁亦无关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16347,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九首 其八","author":"释思岳","text":"天魔谤佛，桀犬吠尧。\n巍巍大人，圣德可昭。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16348,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九首 其三","author":"释思岳","text":"不应山谷一所，透出千门万户。\n清晓一声杜鹃，劝人不如归去。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16349,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九首 其二","author":"释思岳","text":"无阴阳地一片，明明卖贵买贱。\n死尸无处活埋，露出三头两面。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16350,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"颂古九首 其一","author":"释思岳","text":"无根树子一株，山翁不费诛锄。\n锤碎千年桃核，不须缘木求鱼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16351,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"送王山人归千峰","author":"释思雅","text":"旧居千万岑，归去独携琴。\n物外情难遏，云中路再寻。\n花繁溪圃合，柳暗野桥深。\n想到垂纶处，和苔扫竹阴。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16352,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"释思聪","text":"千点乱山横紫翠，一钩新月挂黄昏。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16353,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"释思聪","text":"枇杷花发天欲雪，黄雀不飞枝上寒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16354,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"秋夕","author":"释昭符","text":"又是听猿吟，如何恨更深。\n每因多病日，减却少年心。\n冻鹤连岩雪，愁人半夜砧。\n故园阻兵革，消息遣谁寻。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16355,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"广福寺偶题","author":"释昭辑","text":"涓涓碧水细通池，小雨廉纤未作泥。\n深炷炉烟浓著火，何须骑马听朝鸡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16356,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈二首 其二","author":"释显","text":"禅莫参，道休学，歇意忘机常廓落。\n现成公案早周遮，只个无心已穿凿。\n直饶坐断未生前，难透山僧错错错。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16357,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈二首 其一","author":"释显","text":"吃粥了也，头上安头。\n洗钵盂去，为蛇画足。\n更问如何，自纳败阙。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16358,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"新月","author":"释显彬","text":"微光已成魄，隐隐夕阳间。\n六幕无人卷，一钩长自闲。\n轮随明月长，香逐桂枝还。\n三五相将近，分明照竹关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16359,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"临寂颂","author":"释显嵩","text":"八十年中常浩浩，宏开肆货摩尼宝。\n也无一个共商量，不是山僧收铺早。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16360,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈","author":"释显嵩","text":"昨日罗刹心，今朝菩萨面。\n罗刹与菩萨，不隔一条线。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16361,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"石?","author":"释某","text":"路绕崖悬万仞头，檐泉带月几时休。\n个中拨转通天窍，人自安閒水自流。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16362,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"问诠禅师","author":"释某","text":"觌面难逢处，如何顾鉴咦。\n乞师垂半偈，免使后人疑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16363,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"寿禅师悟道颂","author":"黄庭坚","text":"朴落非他物，纵横不是尘。\n山河及大地，全露法王身。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16364,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈三首 其三","author":"释洪英","text":"石门巇崄铁关牢，举目重重万仞高。\n无角铁牛冲得破，毗卢海内作波涛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16365,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈三首 其二","author":"释洪英","text":"宝峰高士罕曾到，岩前雪压枯松倒。\n岭前岭后野猿啼，一条古路清风扫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16366,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈二首 其二","author":"释洪英","text":"万锻炉中铁蒺藜，直须高价莫饶伊。\n横来竖去呵呵笑，一任旁人鼓是非。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16367,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈二首 其一","author":"释洪英","text":"阿家尝醋三赤喙，新妇洗面摸著鼻。\n道吾答话得腰裈，玄沙开书是白纸。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16368,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈三首 其一","author":"释洪英","text":"青山重叠叠，绿水响潺潺。\n未到悬崖处，抬头子细看。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16369,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其四","author":"释洪英","text":"一句不遑无著问，迄今犹作野盘僧。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16370,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其一","author":"释洪英","text":"喜得狼烟息，弓弰壁上悬。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16371,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其三","author":"释洪英","text":"天际雪埋千尺石，洞门冻折数株松。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16372,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"释洪英","text":"不到乌江畔，知君未肯休。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16373,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"别诸禅众","author":"释洪海","text":"万瓦禅林耸翠螺，四围山色玉新磨。\n恍疑别换胸怀子，霁月光风觉转多。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16374,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈二十二首 其二十二","author":"释洵","text":"若欲正提纲，直教大地荒。\n拟来冲雪刃，不免露锋铓。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16375,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈二十二首 其二十一","author":"释洵","text":"安居无相大伽蓝，莫问前三与后三。\n个里不容生一念，龙蛇猿鸟自相参。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16376,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈二十二首 其十八","author":"释洵","text":"昔人三箭定天山，自谓英雄盖世间。\n何似雪峰一只箭，等闲穿过石门关。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16377,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈二十二首 其十四","author":"释洵","text":"吾君收得中原宝，塞外烟尘净如扫。\n万国歌谣贺太平，家家门馆长安道。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16378,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈二十二首 其六","author":"释洵","text":"一叶翻空便见秋，不风流处也风流。\n当头荐得便归去，看取木人骑土牛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16379,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈二十二首 其三","author":"释洵","text":"万人丛里求知已，百草头边识老僧。\n从此更无回避处，三头两面得人憎。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16380,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈二十二首 其二十","author":"释洵","text":"髑髅捻碎眼睛寒，便把南辰对北看。\n无限风流慵卖弄，乘时推倒铁围山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16381,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"偈二十二首 其十九","author":"释洵","text":"月不堪破五，衲僧猛提取。\n打动东海鱼，失却南山虎。\n借问是何宗，逢人莫错举。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_3.csv","pointer":16382,"sha256":"ed4f93e4cb01a4d649806dad023e91c64a5ee54610a6a94832e9721a01e307e1","dynasty":"宋"}}]